  "text": "Vansidieths rise from the souls of politicians or generals whose pride resulted in great social suffering and tragedy.\nDemonic Generals\nWhile some consider demons to be bickering monsters known more for infighting than uniting in a single army, the story of the Worldwound teaches an important lesson. A powerful demon can organize demonic hordes into an incredibly destructive war machine, and vansidieths often lead those armies as generals, coaxing cooperation from the fiendish rabble."
